note E14 all-exports control: the same two functions as e14-unreached.om with the entry changed to g. Scanned
note from g the secret store to the declared field is reached: it must revoke even with e14. A SHA-style
note export set passes the obligation only when every export that can write the ctx scans like f does.
fn f c view uchar 104 to ulong
if eq get c 32 0
ret 0
end
ret 1
end
fn g c edit uchar 104 a view uchar 1 to ulong
put c 32 get a 0
if eq get c 32 0
ret 0
end
ret 1
end
